* Certification Tracking
* Skills Matrix
* Employee Engagement
* Surveys
* Polls
* Feedback
* Performance Dashboards
* HR Analytics
* Notifications
* Reports
* Audit Trails

The implementation must be scalable enough for a commercial SaaS product.

