Example:

```text
Company Objective
      ↓
Department Objective
      ↓
Team Objective
      ↓
Manager Goal
      ↓
Employee Goal
```

Allow managers to cascade organizational objectives to employees.

Track relationships:

```text
parent_goal_id
child_goal_id
```

An employee should be able to understand how their goals contribute to organizational objectives.

