```text
Communication
Leadership
Teamwork
Ownership
Problem Solving
Customer Focus
Technical Skills
Behavior
```

Allow HR to configure anonymity.

If anonymous feedback is enabled:

* Do not expose reviewer identity to employee.
* Protect identity in APIs.
* Protect identity in database queries.
* Prevent indirect information leakage.

