Implement performance calibration.

HR/authorized leadership can compare ratings across:

* Departments
* Teams
* Managers
* Locations
* Job levels

Support:

```text
Employee
Manager Rating
Calculated Rating
Calibrated Rating
Calibration Comment
Calibration Status
Calibrated By
Calibrated At
```

Calibration should never silently modify the original manager rating.

Store:

```text
Original Rating
Calibrated Rating
Reason
Actor
Timestamp
```

