---

# 52. DATABASE REQUIREMENTS

Every tenant-owned table must have proper tenant isolation.

Use:

```text
tenant_id
```

where appropriate.

Add:

* Foreign keys
* Unique constraints
* Check constraints
* Indexes
* Composite indexes
* Soft-delete where appropriate
* Created timestamps
* Updated timestamps
* Created-by
* Updated-by

Avoid unnecessary indexes.

---

# 53. MULTI-TENANT SECURITY

This is mandatory.

Every request must enforce:

```text
authenticated_user
      ↓
tenant
      ↓
role
      ↓
resource ownership
      ↓
permission
```

Prevent:

* Cross-tenant data access
* IDOR
* Horizontal privilege escalation
* Vertical privilege escalation
* Unauthorized review access
* Unauthorized feedback access
* Anonymous reviewer identity leakage

---

# 54. RBAC

Use existing RBAC system.

Possible permissions:

```text
performance.view
performance.create
performance.update
performance.delete
performance.configure

goal.view
goal.create
goal.update
goal.approve

review.view
review.submit
review.approve
review.finalize

feedback.create
feedback.view
feedback.manage

training.view
training.create
training.assign
training.manage

certification.view
certification.manage

survey.create
survey.manage
survey.respond

promotion.create
promotion.approve

salary_revision.create
salary_revision.approve
```

Do not create a second authorization system.

Extend the existing one.

