# 55. ROLE ACCESS

### Employee

Can:

* View own goals
* Update own progress
* Submit self-assessment
* View permitted feedback
* View own training
* Manage own certifications
* Submit surveys
* View own development plan

### Manager

Can:

* View authorized team
* Approve goals
* Review employees
* Give feedback
* Create development plans
* Recommend promotion
* Recommend salary revision

### HR

Can:

* Configure cycles
* Configure rating systems
* Manage performance
* Manage training
* Manage surveys
* View analytics
* Manage calibration
* Manage engagement

### Admin

Can access tenant-level configuration according to existing RBAC rules.

