# 81. SECURITY TESTS

Explicitly test:

### Cross-Tenant Access

Tenant A must never access Tenant B data.

### IDOR

Changing IDs in URLs must not expose another employee's records.

### RBAC

Employee cannot access HR-only APIs.

### Manager Scope

Manager cannot access employees outside authorized scope.

### Anonymous Feedback

Reviewer identity must remain protected.

### Finalized Review

Unauthorized users cannot modify finalized reviews.

